ch introduced in this paper also yields a proof of similar results for CM abelian varieties  and for CM modular forms, as well as an analog in this setting of Skinner's \u2010converse to the theorem of Gross\u2013Zagier and Kolyvagin.<\/jats:p>","DOI":"10.1112\/plms.70089","type":"journal-article","created":{"date-parts":[[2025,10,10]],"date-time":"2025-10-10T01:09:45Z","timestamp":1760058585000},"update-policy":"https:\/\/doi.org\/10.1002\/crossmark_policy","source":"Crossref","is-referenced-by-count":0,"title":["Tamagawa number conjecture for CM modular forms and Rankin\u2013Selberg convolutions"],"prefix":"10.1112","volume":"131","author":[{"given":"Francesc","family":"Castella","sequence":"first","affiliation":[{"name":"University of California Santa Barbara, South Hall  Santa Barbara California USA"}],"role":[{"role":"author","vocabulary":"crossref"}]}],"member":"311","published-online":{"date-parts":[[2025,10,9]]},"reference":[{"key":"e_1_2_10_2_1","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1007\/978-1-4614-1260-1_2"},{"key":"e_1_2_10_3_1","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.5802\/aif.2206"},{"key":"e_1_2_10_4_1","first-page":"41","article-title":"Anticyclotomic main conjectures for CM modular forms","volume":"606","author":"Arnold T.","year":"2007","journal-title":"J. Reine Angew. Math."},{"issue":"2","key":"e_1_2_10_5_1","first-page":"209","article-title":"On Birch and Swinnerton\u2010Dyer's conjecture for elliptic curves with complex multiplication. I","volume":"37","author":"Arthaud N.","year":"1978","journal-title":"Compositio Math."},{"key":"e_1_2_10_6_1","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.2140\/pjm.2012.260.261"},{"key":"e_1_2_10_7_1","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1215\/00127094-2142056"},{"key":"e_1_2_10_8_1","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1007\/BFb0099438"},{"key":"e_1_2_10_9_1","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.2307\/1971386"},{"key":"e_1_2_10_10_1","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1353\/ajm.2020.0017"},{"key":"e